---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { BRAND_NAME, BASE } from '../site';
---
<Base title="Work" description="Example scopes from {BRAND_NAME} — a small business website, an online store, and a managed WordPress migration. Example scopes, not named client projects.">
<section><div class="container">
<p class="eyebrow">Selected work</p>
<h1>Example work, <em>in detail.</em></h1>
<p class="lead">Every business has its own story, challenges and goals. Here is how thoughtful design brings those pieces together. We are a new team shipping our first client work, so these are <strong>example scopes</strong> — detailed, typical projects of each type, told as a story: the moment, the problem, the approach, what was built, and the result. They are <strong>not</strong> named client projects, and no client names, logos or results are invented here. Real client stories land here as they ship, with real names and real numbers.</p>
<div class="note" style="margin-bottom:28px"><strong>How to read this page:</strong> each card is a type of project we do. Click it for the full scope — problem, what was built, stack, timeline, outcome, and cost drivers. Then book a strategy call to scope yours.</div>
<div class="grid3"><div class="work-card"><div class="art"><span class="pill">Example scope</span><b>Small business website</b></div><div class="body"><p><strong>Problem:</strong> A service business — the kind that lives on phone calls — had a website that did not explain what it did, did not show its services clearly, and did not let anyone book. Most enqui…</p><p><strong>What was built:</strong> A 6-page custom website: Home, Services, About, Pricing, Contact and Booking</p><a href={BASE + "/work/small-business-website"}>Read the full example scope →</a></div></div>
<div class="work-card"><div class="art"><span class="pill">Example scope</span><b>Online store, rebuilt</b></div><div class="body"><p><strong>Problem:</strong> A small shop was selling on social media and in person, and had a store that dropped customers at checkout: slow pages, confusing shipping, and a payment step that failed on phones…</p><p><strong>What was built:</strong> Store rebuilt on Shopify, with the existing products, prices and customers moved over</p><a href={BASE + "/work/online-store"}>Read the full example scope →</a></div></div>
<div class="work-card"><div class="art"><span class="pill">Example scope</span><b>Managed WordPress migration</b></div><div class="body"><p><strong>Problem:</strong> A business had a WordPress site that kept breaking: updates applied blindly, backups that had never been tested, and a host whose support answered with a script. The site went down…</p><p><strong>What was built:</strong> Site copied and tested on managed hosting before the domain was switched — the old site stayed live until the new one was proven</p><a href={BASE + "/work/wordpress-migration"}>Read the full example scope →</a></div></div>
</div>
<div class="section-head" style="margin-top:44px"><p class="eyebrow">Demo websites</p><h2 style="font-size:32px">Click through a demo.</h2><p class="lead">Three complete demo sites — a café, a store, a dental clinic — built the way we build for clients. Demo — example scope, not a client.</p></div>
<div class="grid3">
<div class="work-card"><div class="art"><span class="pill">Demo · Small business website</span><b>Maple &amp; Main Café</b></div><div class="body"><p>Menu, hours, bookings and a story — a café site that gets people through the door.</p><a href={`${BASE}/demos/maple-main`}>Open the demo →</a></div></div>
<div class="work-card"><div class="art" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0E3A5C,#12294D)"><span class="pill">Demo · Online store</span><b>Northwood Outfitters</b></div><div class="body"><p>A store with products, prices and a checkout that works on a phone.</p><a href={`${BASE}/demos/northwood-outfitters`}>Open the demo →</a></div></div>
<div class="work-card"><div class="art" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2A1B6E,#14305E)"><span class="pill">Demo · Service business website</span><b>Harbour Dental</b></div><div class="body"><p>Services, team and booking — a clinic site that answers questions before the call.</p><a href={`${BASE}/demos/harbour-dental`}>Open the demo →</a></div></div>
</div>
<p style="margin-top:32px"><a class="btn" href={BASE + "/contact"}>Contact us →</a></p>
</div></section>
</Base>
